units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
read_data /home/zhenghaowu/fastMD/data/OPLS_methanol/methanol.data
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_modify mix geometric
kspace_style ewald 0.0001
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.5
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 320.0 1.41
bond_coeff 2 340.0 1.09
bond_coeff 3 553.0 0.945
angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff 1 35.0 109.5
angle_coeff 2 33.0 107.8
angle_coeff 3 55.0 108.5
dihedral_style opls
dihedral_coeff 1 0.0 0.0 0.45 0.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.066 3.5
pair_coeff 2 2 0.17 3.12
pair_coeff 3 3 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff 4 4 0.03 2.5
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check no
compute peratom all pe/atom pair bond angle dihedral kspace
dump 1 all custom 1 forces.lmp id fx fy fz
run 0
print "ETOT: $(pe)"
